    "title": "Sacramento Man Arrested for Gun Possession While Asleep in Movie Theater - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sarah Hernandez ,\n1 days ago A Sacramento man was taken into custody at the Downtown Commons movie theater yesterday after police found him asleep with a loaded firearm in his lap. According to a release from the Sacramento Police Department, officers were called to the venue on 4th Street shortly after midnight upon reports of an unconscious individual. The police were able to safely retrieve the weapon before waking and arresting the man. He was identified as 28-year-old Jonathan Vasquez of Sacramento, as reported by KCRA. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
